+## Rate limits
+
+Every `/v1` route allows **100 requests per minute per user** (per client IP
+for anonymous calls), counted over a sliding window. Each response carries:
+
+| Header | Meaning |
+| :- | :- |
+| `RateLimit-Limit` | Requests allowed per window |
+| `RateLimit-Remaining` | Requests left in the current window |
+| `Retry-After` | On a 429 only: seconds until the next request is allowed |
+
+`/v1/health` and `/v1/metrics` are not limited. Operators can change the
+limit with `RATE_LIMIT` and the window with `RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS`.
+
